<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Software Engineer</Major>
    <Description>BEWARE! This uses baitcoins to skip to optimal time of day (19PM). You may need to edit the first duration for throwing so the bar fills up because I had to do that on another guys file.

IMPORTANT: When you level up or a shop is in your display, THE PROGRAM STOPS WORKING and you need to restart the program (Just bind a shortcut in the settings). YOU NEED to set pro tackle load indicator in the settings under game!

DESCRIPTION: 
Macro for Fishing Planet at low star lake for bass.
Auto keeps all fish, just find the bass godspot so you don't have fish that take half your net.
Auto detects when no fish is caught and rethrows.
Setup (This isn't the best one, just mine):  Rod -&gt; Thora 240, Reel -&gt; EspiraML3000, Line -&gt; Braid 0.15mm, Titanium Leader 0.13, Walker 14g #3/0
 
INSTRUCTION:
1.Start the game
2. Assign a macro to a convenient keyboard key in the program
3. Skip time to 19PM because then bass are active and net is full in around an hour ( max 2 hours) and our program skips 22 hours after net is full.
3.Stand in the fishing spot and choose the casting direction
4.Press the key to which the macro has been assigned
5. Catching bass</Description>
